<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>items</key>
	<array>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>Aevon 分屏</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>Aevon 0.0.28（arm64e / roothide）。所有功能只在本页开关，无需终端 / SSH。用法：打开「启用插件」→ 注销 → 在下方设定的热区内向左滑（或按住约 0.4 秒）呼出圆盘；逆时针转半圈后图标开始跟手旋转，顺时针或停住即进入选择，松手开窗。日志：/var/mobile/Aevon.log。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<false/>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.Aevon</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>Enabled</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>启用插件</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<true/>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.Aevon</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>EdgeGestureEnabled</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>右侧边缘左滑呼出圆盘（主入口）</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>圆盘 App</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>圆盘里放哪些 App、按什么顺序排，都在这里改。进入后点「编辑」可以上下拖动排序、左滑删除；点右上「添加」从已安装 App 里勾选加入（最多 36 个）。改完立即生效，下次呼出圆盘就是新顺序。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSButtonCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>编辑圆盘 App（添加 / 排序）</string>
			<key>action</key>
			<string>aevonOpenRingEditor</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>① 触发位置（纵向）</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>热区中心在屏幕高度的百分比。75 = 与圆盘圆心对齐（默认）；想贴着屏幕底部就拉到 95~98，贴着顶部就拉到 2~5。拖动时屏幕右侧那条提示条会实时上下移动，松手即生效。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSliderCell</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>RingTriggerY</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>触发位置：0% = 屏幕顶部，100% = 屏幕底部</string>
			<key>minValue</key>
			<integer>0</integer>
			<key>maxValue</key>
			<integer>100</integer>
			<!-- V0.0.29：PSSliderCell 只认 min/max（不是 minValue/maxValue），
			     缺了这两个键滑杆量程会退化成默认 0~1，一拖就写回 0.x → 触发条永远在顶部 -->
			<key>min</key>
			<integer>0</integer>
			<key>max</key>
			<integer>100</integer>
			<key>default</key>
			<integer>75</integer>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>热区中心落在屏幕高度的百分比，默认 75（正好是圆盘圆心）。
0% 贴屏幕最上面，100% 贴最下面；想单手好够到就 60~85。
拖动时右侧触发条会实时跟着上下移动，设置里的数字同步变化。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>② 触发宽度（横向）</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>热区从屏幕右边缘往左有多宽（pt）。数值越小越不容易误触，但也越难划出；默认 48，建议范围 30~60。拖动时提示条会实时变粗 / 变细。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSliderCell</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>RingTriggerWidth</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>触发宽度：贴着右边缘的厚度（pt）</string>
			<key>minValue</key>
			<integer>18</integer>
			<key>maxValue</key>
			<integer>140</integer>
			<key>min</key>
			<integer>18</integer>
			<key>max</key>
			<integer>140</integer>
			<key>default</key>
			<integer>48</integer>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>热区从右边缘往左有多厚。数值越小越不容易误触，也越难划出；默认 48，建议 30~60。拖动时触发条会实时变粗 / 变细。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>③ 触发高度（纵向）</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>热区上下有多高（pt）。数值越大，屏幕上能呼出圆盘的纵向范围越大；默认 320（约占屏幕 1/3），建议 240~420。拖动时提示条会实时变长 / 变短。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSliderCell</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>RingTriggerHeight</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>触发高度：热区上下的总高度（pt）</string>
			<key>minValue</key>
			<integer>80</integer>
			<key>maxValue</key>
			<integer>900</integer>
			<key>min</key>
			<integer>80</integer>
			<key>max</key>
			<integer>900</integer>
			<key>default</key>
			<integer>320</integer>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>热区纵向总长。越大可呼出的纵向范围越广；默认 320（约屏幕 1/3），建议 240~420。拖动时触发条会实时变长 / 变短。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>如果触发条跑到了不合适的位置（例如贴着屏幕顶部），点下面的按钮一键恢复：位置 75%、宽 48pt、高 320pt。恢复后触发条会立刻回到屏幕右侧中部。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSButtonCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>恢复默认触发区域（75% / 48pt / 320pt）</string>
			<key>action</key>
			<string>aevonResetTriggerZone</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>窗口</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>「窗口保活」让浮窗里的 App 持续运行（会消耗电量）。「浮窗内可直接触摸操作」关闭后浮窗只显示画面、不响应点击。「拖到屏幕边缘自动吸附」：把标题栏拖到左/右边缘松手即变半屏，拖到顶部放大。窗口大小与位置会按 App 记住，下次开窗恢复。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<false/>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.Aevon</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>KeepAlive</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>窗口保活（保持前台）</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<true/>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.Aevon</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>TouchEnabled</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>浮窗内可直接触摸操作</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<true/>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.Aevon</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>SnapEnabled</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>拖到屏幕边缘自动吸附（左右半屏）</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<false/>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.Aevon</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>SwitcherLongPress</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>多任务卡片长按开窗（实验）</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>安全与日志</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>「开机崩溃保护」：每次加载写入 loading，SpringBoard 稳定 20 秒后标记 healthy；若下次启动发现上次仍是 loading，则自动禁用插件，阻断崩溃死循环。「写日志文件」关闭后仍保留系统日志（Console.app 可查）。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<true/>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.Aevon</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>CrashGuard</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>开机崩溃保护</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<true/>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.Aevon</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>LogEnabled</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>写日志文件（/var/mobile/Aevon.log）</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>实验功能</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>「强制前台保持」会改写系统场景状态，风险最高：若开启后注销进入安全模式，请先关闭本项再注销。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<false/>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.Aevon</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>ForceForeground</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>强制前台保持（实验）</string>
		</dict>
	</array>
	<key>title</key>
	<string>Aevon</string>
</dict>
</plist>
